EmailTemplate.textOnly:
Hello {!Contact.FirstName},

Thank you for expressing interest in Arizona State University. We have added you to our mailing list, but you will find that most of our communication is done through email.

We do not mail out any catalogs or view books – just another one of our sustainability practices. However, I’m sure you will find our website very helpful.

First, I encourage you to explore this interactive site about ASU at http://www.asu.edu/myfuture/. It includes videos, student experiences and answers to some most commonly asked questions. You can also find more specific information about degree programs at https://asu.edu/degrees and admission criteria at https://students.asu.edu/freshman/requirements.

Please let me know how I can further assist you in your college search.

{!User.Recruiter_Full_Name__c}
{!User.Recruiter_Title__c}
Admission Services
{!User.Recruiter_Email__c}
{!User.Recruiter_Phone__c}

If you have any additional information or questions related to this, please reply to this email.

{!Case.Thread_Id}
